* Transistors
M1 5 2 4 4 NMOS
M2 6 3 5 5 NMOS

* Capacitors
Cgs1 2 4 Cgs1
Cgd1 5 1 Cgd1
Cdb1 1 4 Cdb1
Cgs2 3 5 Cgs2
Cgd2 6 3 Cgd2
CL 7 8 CL

* Resistors
Rsig 1 2 Rsig
RL 7 8 RL

* Voltage Sources
Vsig 1 0 DC Vsig
Vi 3 0 DC Vi

* Current Sources
Gi 2 4 Vi Gi

* Nodes
* 1 - Input of Rsig
* 2 - Gate of Q1
* 3 - Gate of Q2
* 4 - Source of Q1 and Q2, connected to ground
* 5 - Drain of Q1 and source of Q2
* 6 - Drain of Q2
* 7 - Connected to RL and CL
* 8 - Output Vo